Neon containers port (M1), part 2 of 7: content partition.

Partition helpers from brave-core v1.100.58 (bd6d26d1) and the content hooks
the later patches rely on: a storage partition key on NavigationEntry for
session restore, and ShouldInheritStoragePartition so noopener windows stay
in their container. Replaces Brave chromium_src overrides with plain hunks.

